IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `csa-members`

-- Co-operative Societies Act 1979, ss 5, 39, 42-44, 47-49, 53, 55-57, 60, 71, 73 and 99 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_co-operative-societies-act-1979.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

